    "body": "Closing as a duplicate of #965 (SKULL, manager decision). SKULL's claim on #922 came 13 s before M3's, but #965 is already reviewed and `merge-ready`, covers more suites (134 vs 96), and M3's #967 and #972 stack on it - keeping both would only make conflicts. One idea from this PR that #965 does not have: `scan::app_reexports` + an `app::<name>` alias in `quick::map_modules` derived from `crates/app/src/lib.rs`, so a stale or copied header can never hide its suite again. If wanted after #965 merges, it is on branch `issue/922-gate-maps-moved-modules` (commit ae192299) to cherry-pick.",
